tags: ergo-p2p

A layer: the peer-to-peer protocol of the Ergo reference node, on TCP. A member of a
proof-of-work network of Ergo gives it on one address.

The network magic of the handshake selects the chain. The port of the address selects
the layer: nothing in TCP selects it.

A layer has no value.

=== formal
class=layer
name=ergo-p2p
selected_by=the port of the address
spec=the peer-to-peer protocol of the Ergo reference node (ergoplatform/ergo)
transport=tcp
